  "post_content": "<p>Dos dotaciones de bomberos voluntarios del parque Espad&aacute;n Mijares ha tenido que sofocar la ma&ntilde;ana de este s&aacute;bado un incendio de vegetaci&oacute;n que se ha declarado poco despu&eacute;s de las 10 de la ma&ntilde;ana junto a la carretera CV 20, en la partida de la Baron&iacute;a de Onda, en la parcela 69 del pol&iacute;gono 51.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/P1730497.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Su r&aacute;pida intervenci&oacute;n impidi&oacute; que el fuego se propagara hasta las casas de campo colindantes. Hasta el lugar de los hechos se traslad&oacute; tambi&eacute;n un miembro de la patrulla Ecol&oacute;gico-Rural de la Polic&iacute;a Local.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730483.jpg\" alt=\"p1730483\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730485.jpg\" alt=\"p1730485\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730486.jpg\" alt=\"p1730486\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730487.jpg\" alt=\"p1730487\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730489.jpg\" alt=\"p1730489\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730490.jpg\" alt=\"p1730490\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730491.jpg\" alt=\"p1730491\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730493.jpg\" alt=\"p1730493\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730494.jpg\" alt=\"p1730494\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730495.jpg\" alt=\"p1730495\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730496.jpg\" alt=\"p1730496\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730497.jpg\" alt=\"p1730497\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730498.jpg\" alt=\"p1730498\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730499.jpg\" alt=\"p1730499\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730500.jpg\" alt=\"p1730500\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730501.jpg\" alt=\"p1730501\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730502.jpg\" alt=\"p1730502\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendivegetaciopartidabaroniaonda/p1730504.jpg\" alt=\"p1730504\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendiv